# Headers for STATIC ASSETS only.
#
# No Strict-Transport-Security here, deliberately. The Cloudflare zone setting
# (SSL/TLS -> Edge Certificates -> HSTS) adds it to EVERY response — these
# assets, the Worker's /api and /img responses, and any future subdomain.
# Repeating it here would risk a second HSTS header, and browsers honour only
# the first. See docs/SECURITY_SETUP.md section 2.
#
# Worker-generated responses do NOT inherit these — worker/lib/http.ts applies
# its own set, and the /admin pages build a stricter per-response CSP with a
# nonce. Anything added here that must also hold for API responses has to be
# added there too.

/*
  # NO Content-Security-Policy here.
  #
  # SvelteKit owns it now, in svelte.config.js under kit.csp, and emits it as a
  # <meta> tag carrying the sha256 of the one inline bootstrap script it
  # generates per page. A CSP could not live in both places: browsers enforce
  # the INTERSECTION of a header policy and a meta policy, so a
  # `script-src 'self'` header kept blocking that script no matter what the
  # meta allowed - and the whole app rendered its HTML and then failed to
  # hydrate. See the comment on kit.csp for the full reasoning.
  #
  # X-Frame-Options below is now load-bearing rather than belt-and-braces:
  # `frame-ancestors` is ignored in a meta CSP, so this is what stops framing.
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  # No camera, mic, geolocation or payment anywhere in this app; deny them so a
  # future dependency cannot quietly start asking.
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), usb=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-site

# Hashed build output is immutable by construction - the filename changes when
# the content does - so it can be cached hard, fonts included. Everything else
# stays revalidated so a deploy is visible immediately.
/_app/immutable/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
